            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jemanja ŵandu ŵa mu msinda wa Yelusalemu! Jemanja ŵandu ŵa mu Yelusalemu! Mkusawulaga ŵakulocesya, mkusimwasoma maganga ŵandu ŵa Mlungu ŵiŵatumidwe kwa jemanja! Ana kalingwa kimbele ndili mkusosa kuti nimsonganye jemanja wosope, mpela mujikusasonganyicisya nguku ŵanace ŵakwe kusi kwa mapapiko gakwe, nambo jemanja mwakanile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo malo gimkutamago tigaciŵa masame. Ngumsalila jemanja kuti pa lyele ligongoli ngasimumbona soni une mpaka pa ndaŵi jitimcijila kuti, ‘Jwana upile jwele jwakwisa mu lina lya Ambuje.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
